  "releaseNotes": "# Extend0.BlittableAdapter.Generator\n\n\t\t\t[![NuGet](https://img.shields.io/nuget/v/Extend0.BlittableAdapter.Generator.svg)](https://www.nuget.org/packages/Extend0.BlittableAdapter.Generator)\n\n\t\t\tA source generator that produces blittable interop adapters for structs, enabling zero-cost projection between managed and native-compatible layouts.\n\n\t\t\t## Features\n\n\t\t\t- Emits efficient `ref struct` adapters for blittable data structures.\n\t\t\t- Preserves layout and alignment for use with `Span<T>`, `MemoryMarshal`, and native interop.\n\t\t\t- Enforces compile-time validation of blittability constraints.\n\t\t\t- Supports auto-wrapping of internal fields and projected reinterpretation.",
